{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21000","headline":"瑶华乐 · 李贺","name":"瑶华乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穆天子，走龙媒，八辔冬珑逐天回。\n五精扫地凝云开，高门左右日月环。\n四方错镂棱层殷，舞霞垂尾长盘珊。\n江澄海净神母颜，施红点翠照虞泉。\n曳云拖玉下崑山，列斾如松，张盖如轮。\n金风殿秋，清明发春。\n八銮十乘，矗如云屯。\n琼锺瑶席甘露文，玄霜绦雪何足云，薰梅染柳将赠君。\n铅华之水洗君骨，与君相对作真质。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}